    could be beyond the darkness?","parentUIDs":[0],"SpeechUID":-1}],"Parameters":[],"SpeechNodes":[{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":5},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":6},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":12},{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":13}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":true,"xPos":210.5,"yPos":22},"ID":0,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Evenly
    flicks her head from side to side and sits up as soon as she awakes. She quickly
    pushes herself up. Standing now, she asses the situation. ","parentUIDs":[],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Evelyn
    Ventress","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":60.49997,"yPos":282.000244},"ID":7,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"She
    ignores it, focusing all her attention to slowly moving down the hall. She gives
    her eyes the time to adjust to the dim light.","parentUIDs":[6,12],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Evelyn
    Ventress","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":396.500122,"yPos":261.000122},"ID":8,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"She
    tries to push the fear away from her mind, but she shakes as she begins to make
